out
cscope*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build outputs are not tracked, with one exception: the state-coverage
# artifacts are reviewable outputs, and committing them is what lets CI
# validate the classification on a machine that does not hold the licensed
# Arm documents. A negation cannot reach inside an ignored directory, so the
# directory itself is re-included first.
build/*
!build/state-coverage/
build/state-coverage/*
!build/state-coverage/*.json
